Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Ignore ethernet interface when it is running on NC-SI
 mode but can't find valid NC-SI NIC.

Description:
- Redfish EthernetInterfaceCollection for manager only list valid EthernetInterface.
  For example, eth1 ususally is configured as NCSI mode. It will not show eth1 when NCSI NIC is not available.

* Invalid case

```
root@mi-dcscm:~# ncsi-netlink -x 4 -p 0 -i
